  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was now the day before the Passover Festival. Jesus knew that the hour had come for him to leave this world and go to the Father. He had always loved those in the world who were his own, and he loved them to the very end.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus and his disciples were at supper. The Devil had already put into the heart of Judas, the son of Simon Iscariot, the thought of betraying Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The Devil",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "betraying Jesus",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The Devil had already decided that Judas, the son of Simon Iscariot, would betray Jesus.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus knew that the Father had given him complete power; he knew that he had come from God and was going to God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So he rose from the table, took off his outer garment, and tied a towel round his waist. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he poured some water into a basin and began to wash the disciples' feet and dry them with the towel round his waist. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He came to Simon Peter, who said to him, “Are you going to wash my feet, Lord?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
