          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " So he took a piece of bread, dipped it, and gave it to Judas, the son of Simon Iscariot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As soon as Judas took the bread, Satan entered him. Jesus said to him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None of the others at the table understood why Jesus said this to him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Since Judas was in charge of the money bag, some of the disciples thought that Jesus had told him to go and buy what they needed for the festival, or to give something to the poor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
